      "author_name": "Xi's Moments",
      "message": "#XiJinping, general secretary of the Communist Party of China (#CPC) Central Committee, stressed the need to persevere with full and rigorous Party self-governance to ensure that the CPC remains the strong leadership core in advancing socialism with Chinese characteristics. #XiGovernance Xi made the remarks at a symposium on August 21 to solicit opinions from non-Party personages on drafting the resolution of the CPC Central Committee on certain major issues concerning persevering with full and rigorous Party self-governance. The resolution was adopted at the fifth plenary session of the 20th Central Committee of the CPC, which concluded on Thursday in Beijing. https://english.news.cn/20261030/c5bd4aa0df8848229ae2b6ec672c8312/c.html",
